        "body": "Hi Joanne,<div><br></div><div>Hope you are doing well. </div><div><br></div><div>I set the study as licensed and linked it to the license you had purchased. If you check the dashboard now, you should see the study marked as licensed. This process still is manual on our platform (researcher should request a study to be set as licensed), but we are in the middle of rewriting and improving this completely.</div><div><br></div><div>On a separate note, hope you are doing well and the research projects are also progressing smoothly. If anything, send me an email. Always happy to chat.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Mohammad</div><div>\n<br><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<br><br>\n</div>\n<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Friday, September 20, 2024 at 12:13:40 PM, Joanne Chung wrote:<br><br><div>Hi there, I reached out earlier about this, but I thought that we had purchased an invoice so it is not clear why the data are being deleted. Thanks for any information you can provide.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Joanne</div>\n<div> </div>\n<hr>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<span><b>From:</b> Avicenna Research &lt;no-reply@avicennaresearch.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, September 20, 2024 9:12 AM<br>\n<b>To:</b> Joanne Chung &lt;joanne.chung@utoronto.ca&gt;<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> Data for your study will be deleted in 1 day</span>\n<div> </div>\n</div>\n<table align=\"left\" style=\" background-color: revert; margin: revert; width: 100%; color: revert; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background-color: revert;\">\n<td style=\" border-style: revert; background-color: rgb(166, 166,