 You don't often get email from sales@avicennaresearch.com. <a href=\"https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification\" target=\"_blank\"> Learn why this is important</a> </div>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"middle\" align=\"left\" style=\"background:revert!important; border:revert!important; color:revert!important; font-size:revert!important; margin:revert!important; padding:revert!important; text-align:revert!important; vertical-align:revert!important; width:revert!important; width:75px!important; background-color:#eaeaea!important; padding:7px 5px 7px 5px!important; font-size:12px!important; color:#212121!important; text-align:left!important;\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div>Hi Joanne,<div> </div>\n<div>Hope you are doing well.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>I set the study as licensed and linked it to the license you had purchased. If you check the dashboard now, you should see the study marked as licensed. This process still is manual on our platform (researcher should request a study to be set as licensed), but we are in the middle of rewriting and improving this completely.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>On a separate note, hope you are doing well and the research projects are also progressing smoothly. If anything, send me an email. Always happy to chat.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Best,</div>\n<div>Mohammad</div>\n<div>\n<br>\n<div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br> Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br>\n<div>\n<div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div>\n</div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> https://avicennaresearch.com</a><span class=\"js-signatureMarker\"></span><br> --</div>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<blockquote type=\"cite\"> On Friday, September 20, 2024 at 12:13:40 PM, Joanne Chung wrote:<br>\n<br>\n<div>Hi there, I reached out earlier about this, but I thought that we had purchased an invoice so it is not clear why the data are being deleted. Thanks for any information you can provide.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Joanne</div>\n<div> </div>\n<hr>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<span><b>From:</b> Avicenna Research &lt;no-reply@avicennaresearch.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, September 20, 2024 9:12 AM<br>\n<b>To:</b> Joanne Chung &lt;joanne.chung@utoronto.ca&gt;<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> Data for your study will be deleted in 1 day</span>\n\n</div>\n<table align=\"left\" style=\"background-color:revert; margin:revert; width:100%; color:revert; border-collapse:collapse; border-spacing:0px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background-color:revert;\">\n<td style=\"border-style:revert; background-color:rgb(166,166,166); padding:7px 2px; color:revert;\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left; border-style:revert; background-color:rgb(234,234,234); padding:7px 5px 7px 15px; color:rgb(33,33,33); width:100%;\">\n<div style=\"color:revert;\">\n<span style=\"background-color:revert;\">You don't often get email from no-reply@avicennaresearch.com. <a href=\"https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification\" target=\"_blank\"> Learn why this is important</a></span> </div>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\" style=\"border-style:revert; background-color:rgb(234,234,234); padding:7px 5px; color:rgb(33,33,33); width:75px;\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h4>Just a friendly reminder about your data deletion</h4>\n<p><span>Hi Joanne,<br>\n<br> We wanted to let you know that your trial study on Avicenna Research, #3748, titled </span>\"Daily Life at UTM (Winter 2024)\" will reset in 1 day <span>. This means all data collected so far as part of this study will be removed.<br>\n<br>\n</span>Why my study's data is being erased?<span><br> We regularly clean up trial studies on Avicenna. Of course, you can collect new data for this study, and continue trying out Avicenna. If you would like to keep the study data, please consider purchasing a license. You can do so by contacting <a href=\"mailto:sales@avicennaresearch.com\">sales@avicennaresearch.com </a>.<br>\n<br>\n</span>What exactly is being erased<span><br> Every data that is received from any of the participants, including sensor data, survey responses, cognitive tasks, and participant history. Currently, enrolled participants remain enrolled and can continue uploading data to your study.<br>\n<br>\n</span>How should I stop this?<span><br> If you need to keep these data in your Avicenna account, please contact <a href=\"mailto:sales@avicennaresearch.com\"> sales@avicennaresearch.com </a>and we will be able to help you acquire a license.<br>\n<br> Thanks for using our site!<br> Avicenna</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>For better patient experience.</p>\n<div style=\"color:rgb(147,147,147);\">\n<span><a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/about\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/about\" target=\"_blank\">About </a><a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/blog\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/blog\" target=\"_blank\">Blog </a><a href=\"https://learn.avicennaresearch.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://learn.avicennaresearch.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Learn </a><a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/book-a-demo\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/book-a-demo\" target=\"_blank\">Contact Us</a></span> </div>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/AvicennaRsrch\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://twitter.com/AvicennaRsrch\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://facebook.com/avicennarsrch\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://facebook.com/avicennarsrch\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://linkedin.com/company/avicennaresearch/about\